// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_DISGRUNTLED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2398954268" "I want to die..."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_DISGRUNTLED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2064252024" "Why don't you just leave me alone."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_DISGRUNTLED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
