// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_DISGRUNTLED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P424055614" "Get lost.,"

// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3643865552" "Don't you see?? We're dead now! We're ALL dead!!"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4222958335" "Pull yourself together, man! We're gonna get through this!"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P669115880" "Snap out of it, man!"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3844659817" "This can't be happening!"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1664939588" "Come on, man! Don't lose it now!"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2482228726" "Don't you remember anything? Anything at all??"

// NIGHTWARD_DUST_TALK1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P438558744" "I don't remember much before this day, but I feel we must have been respected peacekeepers."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_TALK1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4278958179" "I feel like exploring. You wanna scope this town out for a bit?"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_TALK1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2658324801" "Despite how heavy my outfit looks, it feels light as a feather."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_TALK1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2224693315" "These clothes make me feel... official!"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_TALK1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P53066782" "You know, I'll bet we are very important people. I mean, look at what we are wearing."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_TALK1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3278952508" "I don't know why we are wearing these outfits... but I don't mind."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_TALK1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P724937464" "I agree that this place is a bit spooky. We'd better stick together."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_TALK1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2214381857" "I've seen those things too, and I think we'd do well to avoid them."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_TALK1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1117290671" "I don't trust those things one bit. Anything that smiles that much must be hiding something."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_TALK1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4275876666" "Sure they look creepy, but who's to say they're malevolent? It's not like we can understand a word they say."

// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1321243763" "Nope. No one's coming for us..."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P504886876" "Oh, man... We're screwed."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2544942650" "Think my memory might be coming back soon. Every one else's is."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3712255435" "Oh man... I am tired."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3606829885" "I don't know and I don't care... to know."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P728178005" "I can't remember anything before this day."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3938120" "I'm frickin' dying of boredom."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P937184476" "Gettin' antsy. That's not good."

// NIGHTWARD_RES_CHAT1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2793313712" "I like the cut of your jiff."
// NIGHTWARD_RES_CHAT1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P448723299" "I wanna see what this town's got to offer. Feel like takin' a run around the block?"
// NIGHTWARD_RES_CHAT1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1880568347" "No, I don't remember how I got here actually. I just showed up with these others who are dressed like me. My guess is we were very important people."
// NIGHTWARD_RES_CHAT1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3290458612" "You are by FAR the most reasonable person I've met in this here town."

// NIGHTWARD_DUST_CHAT2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1022918231" "I like the cut of your hair."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_CHAT2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P839077538" "No, actually... I don't remember anything before this day."
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_CHAT2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2233975008" "Say, that's a really neat outfit. Where can I get one?"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_CHAT2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1502539019" "Oh, yes, those eyeless things are creepy. Best we play it safe and keep our distance."

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4127625387" "What are you?"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2023005030" "What do you want from me??"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2311191622" "Go away..."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4054585291" "Please! Whatever you are, just... let me be!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1952670550" "I want out... I want OUT!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2449748608" "Wake up! WAKE UP! ...Why can't I just wake up!?"

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P646132037" "Leave me alone, all of you!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2721832933" "No no no!!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3656125805" "That's it, screw this place!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2450725004" "That's it! I'm out of here!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_FRIGHTENED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3609461695" "Forget this!"

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_GROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4261805757" "Heh, yeah. And the last thing I ever said to him was go to hell... Guess the joke's on me."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_GROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P460466895" "I don't remember anything... anything at all."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_GROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P987044323" "So this is what it's like to be dead I guess."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_GROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2484092027" "I never believed in heaven. Now I know why."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_GROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4101551164" "Oh, I'm just a-waitin' for the angels to come and take me away!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_GROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1053662508" "Is the sun ever going to come up? It's been dark for days it seems."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_GROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P568589282" "So this is how it all ends I guess... thought I would be happier."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_GROUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1807764486" "We're never going to leave this place. I know that now."

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3929440618" "Life was overrated... I haven't been this at peace in years."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1560192227" "I spent my whole life looking ahead, never truly appreciating what I had. Now it's all gone."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P951463649" "I seem to remember...<em>...never mind. It's gone now."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1633276003" "I... I can't make sense of this. Why am I here with these... people?"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1195863605" "So this is how it all ends... Thought it would be cheerier."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2309278917" "Is the damn sun ever gonna come up? This place is driving me insane."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1707134361" "...I used to be somebody."

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3990355029" "Does anyone know what day it is?<em>...of course not. No one ever does."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1825447186" "Gotta keep my spirits up. Can't risk going back to my dark place."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2613152238" "Can't recall the last time I had a stiff drink.<em>But lord knows I could sure use one now."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3645436797" "If I try really hard I can still see her face."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1817920832" "As strange and terrifying this place is, I still find it somewhat relaxing."

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P86211325" "Wha..?"

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3947024813" "This isn't right... This can't be how it ends. It just can't be"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1998466683" "I feel kind of... funny. Anyone else here feelin' funny?"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1633479556" "She was here a moment ago, but then those things came and lured her away...<em>She never was that bright."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3778973968" "I don't care what those things think. In my opinion she never was really bright."

// NIGHTWARD_RES_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2338989500" "Stop saying we're dead! We're NOT dead!!"
// NIGHTWARD_RES_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2514971399" "Don't let me down! We've made it too far to give up now!"
// NIGHTWARD_RES_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1289798172" "Come on, now! We've made it this far, haven't we?"

// NIGHTWARD_RES_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4191060198" "Yeah, you go right ahead and talk to them. That's what the last guy did and now he's gone."
// NIGHTWARD_RES_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1208848172" "I'm not leavin' this area so long as those creepy dudes are over there."
// NIGHTWARD_RES_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1629276530" "Forget it! No way am I befriending those... things."
// NIGHTWARD_RES_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P52105802" "Hey, check it out! Our outfits are glowin'!"
// NIGHTWARD_RES_TALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1955281584" "I'm kinda bored just standin' 'round... wanna go and see what this town's got to offer?"

// NIGHTWARD_RES_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P365206026" "That's a wrap I guess."
// NIGHTWARD_RES_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P374911314" "So this's heaven..? Pfft."
// NIGHTWARD_RES_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2812702153" "I'm not impressed. Nor am I convinced."
// NIGHTWARD_RES_SLUMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1189663708" "Everyone around here is talkin' crazy like they lost their memories or somethin'.<em>How nice that must be."

// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SURROUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3834165825" "The hell is going on? Where am I??"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SURROUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4294943621" "How can we just stand around at a time like this?"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SURROUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4274477870" "Those... things! What are they? What do they want from us??"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SURROUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2150954376" "Will you two shut up!? Don't you know we're being hunted?"
// NIGHTWARD_DUST_SURROUNDED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1374289036" "If I see ONE more thing, I am making a run for it. With or without you guys."

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_MILKMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P173388443" "Well, ain't this a fine little town!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_MILKMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3609911749" "Such a lovely night... think I just might take a stroll."
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_MILKMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3844085539" "So many shooting stars! What's a fella gonna wish for next?"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_MILKMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2925276716" "No sense in letting the night get me down. The sun's gotta come up some time."

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LINEUP_DRUDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3794393141" "Quiet in th' back!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LINEUP_DRUDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3279278502" "Pipe down back there!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LINEUP_DRUDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1269379285" "Let's be goodly li'l flick'rs. We don't wanna have't put all you back in th' ground now."

