// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3918269569" "Can't I just go already?"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3075253215" "This isn't fair! I've been dead MUCH longer than these people."

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_COUPLE_F_INACTIVE_TEXT :
