// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_COUPLE_M_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2051798101" "Carol! Don't leave, I am going to cross!"

// NIGHTWARD_LINEUP_DRUDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P482587300" "Wot's this? Gett'n antsy are we?"
// NIGHTWARD_LINEUP_DRUDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3226526721" "Just a few dozen more pages and we'll be on our way."
// NIGHTWARD_LINEUP_DRUDGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
